          "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hi, I'm calling because my money got deducted twice for one order. 4,199, two times.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[empathic] I understand your concern. [normal] I can see your order for running shoes, order number [slow] K R T six one two seven zero zero nine eight, where four thousand one hundred ninety-nine rupees was deducted twice. The second payment failed on our side, and an automatic refund of four thousand one hundred ninety-nine rupees has already started with reference number [slow] R F D eight eight two one three. It will reach your bank within five working days, by Friday, nine October.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"The order is, uh, KRT61270098. I paid by UPI yesterday.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, I can confirm that for order [slow] K R T six one two seven zero zero nine eight, your first payment went through successfully for the shoes. The second payment failed on Kartly's side, and the auto-reversal started yesterday, four October. The refund of four thousand one hundred ninety-nine rupees will reach your account by Friday, nine October, and you do not need to do anything.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"The second transaction reference is 427816305610.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, that matches our records. Transaction reference [slow] four two seven eight, one six three zero, five six one zero failed on Kartly's side, and the auto-reversal is in progress under refund reference [slow] R F D eight eight two one three. It will be credited back to your bank account by Friday, nine October.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"So, by what date exactly will I see it back? My rent is due.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[empathic] I completely understand your urgency. The money will reach your bank within five working days, by Friday, nine October at the latest. You don't need to take any action from your side.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Do you need my UPI PIN or anything to process it faster?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[serious] No, absolutely not. Kartly never asks for your U P I P I N, O T P, or any passwords, so please never share them with anyone. The refund is completely automatic and will reach your account by Friday, nine October.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"All right. Thanks for your help.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[happy] You are very welcome! Thank you for calling Kartly, and have a wonderful day ahead.\"}]}",
